<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Friday it raised its rating on the shares of HomeSide Inc to strong buy from buy, with a 12-month price target of $26 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst George Biecher said he raised his fiscal 1999 earnings estimate to $2.15 per share from $2.05.</p>
<p>-- Biecher said the upgrade was based on increased confidence in the company's earnings projections and its better operating leverage.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 20-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
